            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū kūlwa nguno ya shītīle shabo na a maganiko gabo, nū nene nalī bbihī kwiza, nababilinge a banhū ba mahanga gose na ndīmi jose; na ng'hana bakwiza balībone ī likūjo lyane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nakūtūūla shimanīkījo ū mubo, bamò ba babo balasaage nakūbatūma kūja kū mahanga; kūja Talishishi, Libya, Ludi (banhū abo bakumūkile mu mhayo gwa būlasi); kūja Tubali, Javani, na kū majinga ga kūle, ūko bataalī kūlwigwa ū lūkumo lwane nūūlū ū kūlībona ī līkūjo lyane. Bakūja bakūlīkumūchaga ī likūjo lyane ū mu mahanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na a badūgū bing'we pye a bose babenhe Yelusalemu, kū lūgūlū lwane lwela; babize gītī shakwinha sheela kūlī SEEBA. Bakūbenha badamhīlile falasa, bamò mu magogoteni na matololi; bangī ha nzobe na ngamīla, alīhaya SEEBA. Bakūbenha gīt'ūmo Baisilaeli bakenhelaga shakwinha sha būsu kū hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA mu shiseme sheela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamò babo nakūbatūūla ha nīmo gwa būgabīji, na bangī kūbiza Balawī, alīhaya SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalībeeja igūlū ipya na sī mhya, alīhaya SEEBA. Ūmo shilī sha kūshinga ho ū kū būtongi wane ī shenīsho, nī lina ling'we nī lya shibyalīlwe shing'we līkūbiza lya kūshinga ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwīngīīla būfuma ng'weji kūshisha būfuma ng'weji, na kwīngīīla sabato kūshisha sabato, banhū bose pye bakwiza biname kū būtongi wane, alīhaya SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama bakūja ī hanze ya nzengo kwīlola ī mibimba ya banhū abo baalī banigomelile; nguno ī ngino ja kūbalya jitūshila, nū moto gwa kūbanogoteja gūtūjima; nīyo bakūbiza būsoso wabūbi no ū kū banhū pye a bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
